<title>CYPRUS: Canadian Bow Valley secures Iran oilfield deal-MEE.</title>
<headline>Canadian Bow Valley secures Iran oilfield deal-MEE.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian energy firm Bow Valley has signed a contract to develop Iran's offshore Balal oilfield, the Middle East Economic Survey (MEES) reported on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Bow Valley's independent bid replaces an earlier proposal submitted by the Canadian firm in conjunction with U.K. engineers Pell Frischmann,&quot; the Cyprus-based newletter reported.</p>
</text>
